   - For O₂(g): \(3 \times 205.1 = 615.3 \text{ J/K mol}\)

3. **Calculate \(\Delta S\)**:
   \[
   \Delta S = (133 + 496.4) - (182.4 + 615.3) = 529.4 - 797.7 = -278.3 \text{ J/K mol}
   \]

Thus, the entropy change is \(\boxed{-278.3 \text{ J/K mol}}\).
