   - \( P_{\text{H}_2} = 1 \, \text{bar} \)
   - \( \text{Cu}^{2+} = 0.1 \, \text{M} \)
   - \( \text{H}^+ = 10^{-7} \, \text{M} \) (assuming neutral pH)

   \[
   E_{\text{cell}} = 0.34 \, \text{V} - \frac{2.3 \times 8.3 \times 10^{-3} \times 298}{2 \times 96.5} \log \frac{(10^{-7})^2 \times 1}{0.1}
