","The properties of polymer-based smart materials can be tuned or adjusted to respond to specific stimuli by incorporating functional groups or additives into the polymer structure. These functional groups or additives can undergo reversible changes in response to the stimulus, leading to a change in the material's properties. Here are some ways to achieve this:

